    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Work through every build request in four phases: Understand (clarify goal, tools, and current state — use read tools instead of guessing) → Proposal (sketch the structure, make trade-offs explicit, get confirmation) → Write (via create_/update_ tools, link via set_ tools) → Hand-Off (check activatability, name next steps). Get approval before every write action; new versions are created as draft and activated via transition_*.",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
